# Menus and dialogs, mIRC-style: Tools, Options, the Channels List, the
# nick popup, the Address Book.
Output docs/gifs/menus.gif
Source dev/vhs/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear; ./trout --demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Alt+t
Sleep 1.8s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Alt+o
Sleep 1.5s
Left
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Alt+l
Sleep 1.5s
Down@300ms 6
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Shift+Tab
Down@350ms 4
Sleep 500ms
Space
Sleep 2s
Escape
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Alt+b
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
